<div class="page--narrow hero">
  <span class="hero__eyebrow">For dental professionals</span>
  <h1>Land your next role without the paperwork</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">Upload your CV and we'll build your candidate profile for our recruiters in seconds. You review and confirm every detail before anything is shared.</p>

  <div class="hero__actions">
    <%= link_to "Create a candidate account", new_registration_path, class: "btn" %>
    <%= link_to "Sign in", new_session_path, class: "btn btn--secondary" %>
  </div>

  <ul class="feature-list">
    <li>Your CV is read automatically to pre-fill your profile.</li>
    <li>You stay in control &mdash; edit or correct anything before submitting.</li>
    <li>Recruiters only see your profile once you confirm it.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
